<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔναυσμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναύω</span> A) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spark</i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				11.8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῳοῖσιν ἔ</span>. <i>that
				which gives life</i> to animals, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				11.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φύσις τοῖς σώμασιν ἐντίθησιν
				τῆς οἰκείας ἰδιότητος ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Cra.</u>
				p.30P.
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιζ́</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., <i>spark, glimmer</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				9.28.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Flam.</u>
				11
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναύσματα εὐγενείας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.437
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i>slight indications</i> of a testator's wishes,
				<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				107
			</span></i>
			<u>Pr.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>stimulus, incentive</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀρετῶν
			ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				10
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				11.2
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιαῦτα ἔχων ἐ. ἐς βασιλείας
					ἐπιθυμίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					2.15.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
